Today is Wednesday, and I am in the cafeteria with Rohan.
We are drinking coffee and chatting.
I tell him about my Saturday plan.
"Rohan, on Saturday I will go to Priya's house for dinner," I say.
Rohan smiles and says, "Oh wow!"
"How will you go?" he asks.
I think that taking the metro will be the easiest way.
"I will take the metro," I tell him.
"Priya's neighbourhood is near the metro station."
Then I ask him for some advice.
"Rohan, as a guest what should I take for her?"
"Should I buy some flowers?"
Rohan shakes his head and says no.
"I think that you should take Indian sweets," he suggests.
"Everyone here likes sweets a lot."
This is a very good idea.
"Okay, let's do just that," I say happily.
"I will buy a box of Kaju Katli."
"Good choice!" Rohan says.
"Priya will definitely like it."
Now I am very excited for this visit on Saturday.
